{"content":[{"c":["MAKKEDAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["One of the Shephelah towns conquered during the southern campaign led by Joshua (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.10.10-29","r":"Josh.10.10-29","rawR":"Josh.10.10-29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.10.10-29","value":"Josh.10.10-29"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 10:10-29"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.12.16","r":"Josh.12.16","rawR":"Josh.12.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.12.16","value":"Josh.12.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"12:16"},"). It belonged to the same district as Lachish (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.41","r":"Josh.15.41","rawR":"Josh.15.41","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.41","value":"Josh.15.41"}],"t":"ref","v":"15:41"},"). Eusebius placed it eight Roman miles east of Eleutheropolis (Beth-guvrin), which would lead to Beit-Maqdum, a Roman-Byzantine ruin beside the Roman road from Eleutheropolis to Hebron. The biblical site may have been at Khirbet el-Qom about one-half mile (.8 kilometer) to the southwest."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Makkedah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 10:10-29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.10.10-29","rawQueryValue":"Josh.10.10-29","sourceRefExact":"Josh.10.10-29"},{"anchorText":"12:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.12.16","rawQueryValue":"Josh.12.16","sourceRefExact":"Josh.12.16"},{"anchorText":"15:41","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.41","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.41","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.41"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"60413713790b85b4d83cc8c927a0f4abdff5ca766e6300a2157fc9b1149b8f80","sourceItemName":"Makkedah","sourceItemOrder":81,"sourceMember":"Articles/M.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Makkedah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Makkedah","title":"Makkedah","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}